                "name": "langfuse",
                "namespace": "langfuse",
                "notes": "CHART NAME: zookeeper\nCHART VERSION: 13.7.4\nAPP VERSION: 3.9.3\n\nDid you know there are enterprise versions of the Bitnami catalog? For enhanced secure software supply chain features, unlimited pulls from Docker, LTS support, or application customization, see Bitnami Premium or Tanzu Application Catalog. See https://www.arrow.com/globalecs/na/vendors/bitnami for more information.\n\n** Please be patient while the chart is being deployed **\n\nZooKeeper can be accessed via port 2181 on the following DNS name from within your cluster:\n\n    langfuse-zookeeper.langfuse.svc.cluster.local\n\nTo connect to your ZooKeeper server run the following commands:\n\n    export POD_NAME=$(kubectl get pods --namespace langfuse -l \"app.kubernetes.io/name=zookeeper,app.kubernetes.io/instance=langfuse,app.kubernetes.io/component=zookeeper\" -o jsonpath=\"{.items[0].metadata.name}\")\n    kubectl exec -it $POD_NAME -- zkCli.sh\n\nTo connect to your ZooKeeper server from outside the cluster execute the following commands:\n\n    kubectl port-forward --namespace langfuse svc/langfuse-zookeeper 2181:2181 \u0026\n    zkCli.sh 127.0.0.1:2181\n\nWARNING: There are \"resources\" sections in the chart not set. Using \"resourcesPreset\" is not recommended for production. For production installations, please set the following values according to your workload needs:\n  - tls.resources\n+info https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/configuration/manage-resources-containers/\n\n⚠ SECURITY WARNING: Original containers have been substituted. This Helm chart was designed, tested, and validated on multiple platforms using a specific set of Bitnami and Tanzu Application Catalog containers. Substituting other containers is likely to cause degraded security and performance, broken chart features, and missing environment variables.\n\nSubstituted images detected:\n  - docker.io/bitnamilegacy/zookeeper:3.9.3-debian-12-r8\n\n⚠ SECURITY WARNING: Verifying original container images was skipped. Please note this Helm chart was designed, tested, and validated on multiple platforms using a specific set of Bitnami and Tanzu Application Catalog containers. Substituting other containers is likely to cause degraded security and performance, broken chart features, and missing environment variables.\n\n\nCHART NAME: clickhouse\nCHART VERSION: 8.0.5\nAPP VERSION: 25.2.1\n\nDid you know there are enterprise versions of the Bitnami catalog? For enhanced secure software supply chain features, unlimited pulls from Docker, LTS support, or application customization, see Bitnami Premium or Tanzu Application Catalog. See https://www.arrow.com/globalecs/na/vendors/bitnami for more information.\n\n** Please be patient while the chart is being deployed **\n\nClickHouse is available in the following address:\n\n    kubectl port-forward --namespace langfuse svc/langfuse-clickhouse 9000:9000 \u0026\n\nCredentials:\n\n    echo \"Username      : default\"\n    echo \"Password      : $(kubectl get secret --namespace langfuse langfuse -o jsonpath=\"{.data.clickhouse-password}\" | base64 -d)\"\n\n⚠ SECURITY WARNING: Original containers have been substituted. This Helm chart was designed, tested, and validated on multiple platforms using a specific set of Bitnami and Tanzu Application Catalog containers. Substituting other containers is likely to cause degraded security and performance, broken chart features, and missing environment variables.\n\nSubstituted images detected:\n  - docker.io/bitnamilegacy/clickhouse:25.2.1-debian-12-r0\n\n⚠ SECURITY WARNING: Verifying original container images was skipped. Please note this Helm chart was designed, tested, and validated on multiple platforms using a specific set of Bitnami and Tanzu Application Catalog containers. Substituting other containers is likely to cause degraded security and performance, broken chart features, and missing environment variables.\n\n",
                "revision": 1,
                "values": "{\"clickhouse\":{\"auth\":{\"existingSecret\":\"langfuse\",\"existingSecretKey\":\"clickhouse-password\"},\"extraOverrides\":\"\\u003cclickhouse\\u003e\\n  \\u003ctrace_log remove=\\\"1\\\"/\\u003e\\n  \\u003ctext_log remove=\\\"1\\\"/\\u003e\\n  \\u003copentelemetry_span_log remove=\\\"1\\\"/\\u003e\\n  \\u003casynchronous_metric_log remove=\\\"1\\\"/\\u003e\\n  \\u003cmetric_log remove=\\\"1\\\"/\\u003e\\n  \\u003clatency_log remove=\\\"1\\\"/\\u003e\\n\\u003c/clickhouse\\u003e\\n\",\"replicaCount\":3,\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"cpu\":\"2\",\"memory\":\"8Gi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"2\",\"memory\":\"8Gi\"}},\"zookeeper\":{\"replicaCount\":3,\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"cpu\":\"1\",\"memory\":\"2Gi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"1\",\"memory\":\"2Gi\"}}}},\"global\":{\"defaultStorageClass\":\"efs\"},\"langfuse\":{\"encryptionKey\":{\"secretKeyRef\":{\"key\":\"encryption_key\",\"name\":\"langfuse\"}},\"ingress\":{\"annotations\":{\"alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/inbound-cidrs\":\"0.0.0.0/0\",\"alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/listen-ports\":\"[{\\\"HTTP\\\":80}, {\\\"HTTPS\\\":443}]\",\"alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/scheme\":\"internet-facing\",\"alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect\":\"443\",\"alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/target-type\":\"ip\"},\"className\":\"alb\",\"enabled\":true,\"hosts\":[{\"host\":\"langfuse.noonehasthisdomain.click\",\"paths\":[{\"path\":\"/\",\"pathType\":\"Prefix\"}]}]},\"nextauth\":{\"secret\":{\"secretKeyRef\":{\"key\":\"nextauth-secret\",\"name\":\"langfuse\"}},\"url\":\"https://langfuse.noonehasthisdomain.click\"},\"resources\":{\"limits\":{\"cpu\":\"2\",\"memory\":\"4Gi\"},\"requests\":{\"cpu\":\"2\",\"memory\":\"4Gi\"}},\"salt\":{\"secretKeyRef\":{\"key\":\"salt\",\"name\":\"langfuse\"}},\"serviceAccount\":{\"annotations\":{\"eks.amazonaws.com/role-arn\":\"arn:aws:iam::206409480438:role/kubernetes/langfuse\"}},\"web\":{\"livenessProbe\":{\"initialDelaySeconds\":60},\"readinessProbe\":{\"initialDelaySeconds\":60},\"replicas\":0},\"worker\":{\"replicas\":1}},\"postgresql\":{\"auth\":{\"database\":\"langfuse\",\"existingSecret\":\"langfuse\",\"secretKeys\":{\"userPasswordKey\":\"postgres-password\"},\"username\":\"langfuse\"},\"deploy\":false,\"host\":\"langfuse-postgres.cluster-ceviyi5z4s3h.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com:5432\"},\"redis\":{\"auth\":{\"existingSecret\":\"langfuse\",\"existingSecretPasswordKey\":\"redis-password\"},\"deploy\":false,\"host\":\"master.langfuse.of83ee.use1.cache.amazonaws.com\",\"tls\":{\"enabled\":true}},\"s3\":{\"batchExport\":{\"prefix\":\"exports/\"},\"bucket\":\"langfuse-noonehasthisdomain-click-langfuse\",\"deploy\":false,\"eventUpload\":{\"prefix\":\"events/\"},\"forcePathStyle\":false,\"mediaUpload\":{\"prefix\":\"media/\"},\"region\":\"us-east-1\"}}",
